**manifest.json (Manifest V3)**
```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Data Saver",
  "version": "1.0",
  "permissions": ["storage"]
}
```

**background.js (或 service worker)**
```javascript
// 1. 保存数据 (异步)
